<title>BARBADOS: CRICKET-RED STRIPE CUP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-RED STRIPE CUP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>BRIDGETOWN 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results on the final day of four-day Red Stripe Cup cricket matches on Monday:</p>
<p>In Castries, St Lucia: Jamaica beat the Windward Islands by 31 runs. Jamaica 77 and 184. Windward Islands 104 and 126 (F.Rose 4-25).</p>
<p>Georgetown: Guyana v Leeward Islands - Match abandoned because of rain.</p>
</text>
